{"id":"ce2c2e33d033a7de","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-skolemization.md","title":"Skolemization","display":"df-skolemization — Skolemization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-skolemization","aliases":["72-df-skolemization"],"display":"df-skolemization — Skolemization","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.5.2 print49–50/PDF61–62; rectified closed prenex specialization","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-skolemization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-skolemization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-skolemization — Skolemization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.5.2 print49–50/PDF61–62; rectified closed prenex specialization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=Q_0x_0\\cdots Q_{n-1}x_{n-1}\\theta\">\\(\\varphi=Q_0x_0\\cdots Q_{n-1}x_{n-1}\\theta\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a> 语法的闭前束句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_i\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q_i\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 无量词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec u_i\">\\(\\vec u_i\\)</span> 按原次序枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{x_j:j&lt;i,Q_j=\\forall\\}\">\\(\\{x_j:j&lt;i,Q_j=\\forall\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对每个存在指标选择互异的新符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i\">\\(f_i\\)</span>，元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\vec u_i|\">\\(|\\vec u_i|\\)</span>；零元符号加到常量分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，正元符号加到函数分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>，元数映射相应扩充，得到明确五分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\vec f}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\vec f}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}\">\\(i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}\\)</span> 正好是全称指标。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sk}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sk}\\)</span> 以此指定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec f\">\\(\\vec f\\)</span> 为参数，不能忘记新符号选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\Sigma\\)</span> 是对常量、函数、关系解释的限制，论域不变；满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta[s(x_0)/x_0,\\ldots,s(x_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]\">\\(\\theta[s(x_0)/x_0,\\ldots,s(x_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]\\)</span> 定义为按下标递增逐次使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}\\)</span> 的结果；全称变量分支是恒等代入，存在分支的项只含先行全称变量，故这个递归等于同时代入。零元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i\">\\(f_i\\)</span> 在项位置表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{con}(f_i)\">\\(\\operatorname{con}(f_i)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M&#39;\">\\(\\mathfrak M&#39;\\)</span> 分别遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_{\\vec f}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_{\\vec f}}\\)</span> 的结构。约化精确为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle D,I_C&#39;\\restriction C,I_F&#39;\\restriction F,I_R&#39;\\restriction R\\rangle\">\\(\\langle D,I_C&#39;\\restriction C,I_F&#39;\\restriction F,I_R&#39;\\restriction R\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s(x_i):=\\begin{cases}x_i,&amp;Q_i=\\forall,\\\\f_i,&amp;Q_i=\\exists\\land|\\vec u_i|=0,\\\\f_i(\\vec u_i),&amp;Q_i=\\exists\\land|\\vec u_i|&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi):=\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}\\theta[s(x_0)/x_0,\\ldots,s(x_{n-1})/x_{n-1}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s(x_i):=\\begin{cases}x_i,&amp;Q_i=\\forall,\\\\f_i,&amp;Q_i=\\exists\\land|\\vec u_i|=0,\\\\f_i(\\vec u_i),&amp;Q_i=\\exists\\land|\\vec u_i|&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi):=\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}\\theta[s(x_0)/x_0,\\ldots,s(x_{n-1})/x_{n-1}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\mathfrak M&#39;\\ (\\mathfrak M&#39;\\upharpoonright\\Sigma=\\mathfrak M\\land\\mathfrak M&#39;\\models\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\mathfrak M&#39;\\ (\\mathfrak M&#39;\\upharpoonright\\Sigma=\\mathfrak M\\land\\mathfrak M&#39;\\models\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Skolem形是扩充签名中的全称句；等满足性需要扩张/约化，不能写成原语言内等价。ZFC选择公理为每个先行全称参数元组选取见证。书中对有自由参数的Skolem函数定义另含自由参数；此原子限定闭句并按先行全称变量给出实际依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi=Q_0x_0\\cdots Q_{n-1}x_{n-1}\\theta$ 是 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]] 语法的闭前束句，$Q_i\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$，$x_i$ 互异，$\\theta$ 无量词；$\\vec u_i$ 按原次序枚举 $\\{x_j:j<i,Q_j=\\forall\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\Sigma$ 是对常量、函数、关系解释的限制，论域不变；满足关系见 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi=Q_0x_0\\cdots Q_{n-1}x_{n-1}\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"Q_i\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec u_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\{x_j:j<i,Q_j=\\forall\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f_i","display":false},{"tex":"|\\vec u_i|","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\vec f}","display":false},{"tex":"i_0<\\cdots<i_{k-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sk}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\upharpoonright\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta[s(x_0)/x_0,\\ldots,s(x_{n-1})/x_{n-1}]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubFml}_{72}","display":false},{"tex":"f_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{con}(f_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M'","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_{\\Sigma_{\\vec f}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle D,I_C'\\restriction C,I_F'\\restriction F,I_R'\\restriction R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"s(x_i):=\\begin{cases}x_i,&Q_i=\\forall,\\\\f_i,&Q_i=\\exists\\land|\\vec u_i|=0,\\\\f_i(\\vec u_i),&Q_i=\\exists\\land|\\vec u_i|>0,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi):=\\forall x_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall x_{i_{k-1}}\\theta[s(x_0)/x_0,\\ldots,s(x_{n-1})/x_{n-1}].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\mathfrak M'\\ (\\mathfrak M'\\upharpoonright\\Sigma=\\mathfrak M\\land\\mathfrak M'\\models\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi))).","display":true}],"bytes":2691,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-skolemization|df-skolemization — Skolemization]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-skolemization|df-skolemization — Skolemization]]"},{"id":"67e22e42f3c205d1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\chi\\in X_\\Sigma$ 是不含等号原子的闭句。选择与 $\\neg\\chi$ 等价的闭前束句 $\\varphi$，指定 [[72-df-skolemization]] 的新符号族 $\\vec f$；$\\operatorname{Sk}_{\\vec f}(\\varphi)=\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{n-1}\\theta$。$\\Sigma'$ 是扩充后的五分量签名；若没有闭项，再添一个新常量，故 $\\operatorname{HU}_{\\Sigma'}\\ne\\varnothing$。"}],"outgoing":["3c073b947b255638","5c014dab66d624c8"]}